dfulness-meditation/id1500780518","publisher":"Medito Foundation","retrieved_at":"2026-10-14T00:00:00.000Z"},{"seed_key":"meditation-owner-2026-10-15","source_type":"manual","title":"Owner Android guided meditation playback evidence — PR5.54","url":"https://github.com/WhiteHsu/software-discovery-engine/blob/f98de5b4d4cc9806164c1151ad7b25fe60ad3839/MEDITATION_OWNER_RESULTS.md","publisher":"Software Discovery Engine owner","retrieved_at":"2026-10-14T00:00:00.000Z"},{"seed_key":"meditation-s1-2026-10-15","source_type":"official","title":"S1 — App is currently free; email account required; mobile/web access and adult guided activities documented. Statement excludes treatment purpose.","url":"https://www.smilingmind.com.au/app-product-information-statement","publisher":"Smiling Mind","retrieved_at":"2026-10-14T00:00:00.000Z"},{"seed_key":"meditation-s2-2026-10-15","source_type":"official","title":"S2 — Adult meditation and learning pathways, content search/filtering, routines and progress; charity-supported free individual access.","url":"https://www.smilingmind.com.au/smiling-mind-app","publisher":"Smiling Mind","retrieved_at":"2026-10-14T00:00:00.000Z"},{"seed_key":"meditation-s3-2026-10-15","source_type":"app_store","title":"S3 — Developer description includes offline downloads. Listing iOS 16.4+, interface English; this AU storefront is not owner-region installation proof.","url":"https://apps.apple.com/au/app/smiling-mind-mental-wellbeing/id560442518","publisher":"Smiling Mind","retrieved_at":"2026-10-14T00:00:00.000Z"}]$verify$::jsonb) x WHERE NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM software_discovery.evidence_sources t WHERE t.seed_key=x->>'seed_key' AND t.source_type=x->>'source_type' AND t.title=x->>'title' AND t.url=x->>'url' AND t.publisher=x->>'publisher' AND t.retrieved_at=(x->>'retrieved_at')::timestamptz))
